description\': \'Unix timestamp, must be valid within the next 10 minutes\'}, {\'name\': \'SESSION_ID\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'Allocated session id, obtained from a prior successful login or session creation\'}, {\'name\': \'body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'Details of the DDoS attack flow template to be created, as per the AttackFlowCreateRequest schema\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/attackapi.AttackFlowCreateRequest\'}}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'response\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'Response containing the result of the DDoS attack flow template creation, as per the AttackFlowCreateResponse schema\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/attackapi.AttackFlowCreateResponse\'}}]}, {\'step\': 2, \'description\': \'Update DDoS attack flow parameters\', \'guidance\': \'Call /v1/cl/ddos/attack/flow/param/update to update the DDoS attack flow parameters, including setting the traffic peak to 500Mbps, test duration to 60 seconds, and destination IP to 11.0.0.1/24. The timestamp should be a Unix timestamp valid for 10 minutes, and a session ID is required.\', \'input\': [{\'name\': \'BASE_URL\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'API base without trailing slash\'}, {\'name\': \'TIMESTAMP\', \'type\': \'int\', \'description\': \'unix timestamp, expired in 10 minutes\'}, {\'name\': \'SESSION_ID\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'allocated session id\'}, {\'name\': \'body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'Request body containing the updated DDoS attack flow parameters\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/attackapi.AttackFlowParamUpdateRequest\'}}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'response_body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'Response body containing the result of the update operation\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/attackapi.AttackFlowParamUpdateResponse\'}}]}, {\'step\': 3, \'description\': \'保存已配置好的DDoS攻击流量模板以便后续使用\', \'guidance\': \'通过POST方法调用/v1/cl/ddos/attack/flow/save接口，来保存一个已经配置完成的DDoS攻击流量模板。此请求需要在URL中包含一个有效期内（10分钟）的时间戳和会话ID，并且请求体中携带AttackFlowSaveRequest对象。\', \'input\': [{\'name\': \'BASE_URL\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'API base without trailing slash\'}, {\'name\': \'TIMESTAMP\', \'type\': \'int\', \'description\': \'unix timestamp, expired in 10 minutes, type is int\'}, {\'name\': \'SESSION_ID\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'allocated session id\'}, {\'name\': \'body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'AttackFlowSaveRequest object containing the DDoS attack flow template to be saved\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/attackapi.AttackFlowSaveRequest\'}}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'response_body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'The response body contains AttackFlowSaveResponse as defined in the API specification.\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/attackapi.AttackFlowSaveResponse\'}}]}, {\'step\': 4, \'description\': \'Run a specified testcase with given ID\', \'guidance\': \'This step aims to run a specific testcase using its ID. Call the /v1/cl/testcase/run endpoint via POST method. Ensure that you provide a valid session_id and timestamp (valid for 10 minutes) as query parameters, and include the necessary request body.\', \'input\': [{\'name\': \'BASE_URL\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'API base without trailing slash\'}, {\'name\': \'SESSION_ID\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'allocated session id\'}, {\'name\': \'TIMESTAMP\', \'type\': \'int\', \'description\': \'unix timestamp, expired in 10 minutes\'}, {\'name\': \'body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'Request body for running a testcase\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/testapi.TestcaseRunRequest\'}}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'response\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'Response from running the testcase\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/testapi.TestcaseRunResponse\'}}]}, {\'step\': 5, \'description\': \'Search real-time category statistics for a specific test case