in a StatsSearchRequest object.\', \'input\': [{\'name\': \'BASE_URL\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'API base without trailing slash\'}, {\'name\': \'TIMESTAMP\', \'type\': \'int\', \'description\': \'unix timestamp, expired in 10 minutes, type is int\'}, {\'name\': \'SESSION_ID\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'allocated session id\'}, {\'name\': \'body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'A StatsSearchRequest object containing details for the search criteria\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/statsapi.StatsSearchRequest\'}}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'response\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'A StatsSearchResponse object containing the detailed statistics information\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/statsapi.StatsSearchResponse\'}}]}, {\'step\': 7, \'description\': \'User logout\', \'guidance\': \'Call /v1/cl/user/logout to safely log out the user from the system. This API requires a valid session_id and a timestamp that is not older than 10 minutes.\', \'input\': [{\'name\': \'BASE_URL\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'API base without trailing slash\'}, {\'name\': \'TIMESTAMP\', \'type\': \'int\', \'description\': \'unix timestamp, expired in 10 minutes, type is int\'}, {\'name\': \'SESSION_ID\', \'type\': \'str\', \'description\': \'allocated session id\'}, {\'name\': \'body\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'request body for the logout process\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/alps.UserLogoutRequest\'}}], \'output\': [{\'name\': \'response\', \'type\': \'object\', \'description\': \'logout response object\', \'schema\': {\'$ref\': \'#/definitions/alps.UserLogoutResponse\'}}]}]\n</RAW_TESTCASE>\n\n\n## 二、目标测试用例整体结构规范（必须严格遵守）\n\n最终输出的测试用例必须是一个 JSON 对象，并且 **顶层必须包含以下字段**：\n\n{\n  "name": "Simple testcase",\n  "demand": "testcase v0.0.0",\n  "tester": "XRT Darpeng",\n  "steps": [ ... ]\n}\n\n---\n\n## 三、目标测试步骤（steps）结构输出规范\n\n生成后的steps 中的每一个元素必须符合以下结构（字段齐全，层级一致）：\n\n{\n  "step": number,\n  "description": string,\n  "guidance": string,\n  "input": [\n    {\n      "name": string,\n      "type": string,\n      "description": string\n    }\n  ],\n  "output": [\n    {\n      "name": string,\n      "type": string,\n      "description": string\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n\n---\n\n### 四、修改原则（必须严格遵守）\n1. "name"、"demand"、"tester" 字段必须存在，且不改变其值\n2. "steps" 必须是一个有序数组，表示测试执行步骤，内容参考PARAMS\n3. 目标测试用例中input参数列表中每个参数的description字段根据PARAMS中input参数列表中对应参数的source_type，source_step_id，source_output_field，generated_value这四个字段生成\n4. **只做结构与表达层面的修改**\n   - 允许：格式补全\n   - 不允许：引入新的测试步骤、新的测试数据\n\n5. **测试语义保持完全一致**\n   - 每个步骤的输入、操作、预期含义不得改变\n\n6. **对齐标准格式**\n   - 层级结构与标准格式一致\n\n7. 目标测试用例的step字段的值应设置为从0开始递增\n---\n\n### 三、输出要求\n\n1. 仅输出【修改后的测试用例】, 不要输出任何解释、分析、对比说明或多余文本\n2. 输出必须是合法的 JSON，可被程序直接解析\n\n---\n\n### 四、输出示例风格（仅作参考）\n- 使用清晰、正式、测试文档风格的描述\n- 避免口语化或推理性语言\n\n---\n\n现在请开始修改测试用例。'}]}}
